    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1309">

                <pb facs="1042" n="926" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg926"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/717.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Special Agent
                        Silliman</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department has following telegram from Consul General, Monterey, relating to
                    mining decree of March 1:</p>
                <p>[Quotes Mr. Hanna’s July 22.]</p>
                <p>Urgently endeavor obtain desired modification and ask that notice thereof be
                    given by telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
